  "releaseNotes": "HttpSessionProtocol:\n      - Implemented RequestModel Lazy-Loading.\n      - Rent from pool only when header detected.\n      - Drastically reduced idle session footprint.\n      - Enhanced Early-Release logic for RequestModel.\n      - Auto-return to pool after handler callbacks.\n      - Maximized object churn and L1/L2 cache locality.\n      - Strategic Internal Field Access (Hot Path).\n      - Replaced property getters with field references.\n      - Eliminated redundant checks via null-forgiving.\n      - Minimized branch mispredictions for high throughput.",
